  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.1 - Rochas.SqlWrapper 1.1.2 -> 1.4.8 (valid GROUP BY on PostgreSQL + EntityReflector with cache), Rochas.BWOQ 1.6.4 -> 1.6.5. v2.0.0 - [NEW] PostgreSQL support in CompositeCommand (parameterized Query/Search Paginate, Add, Update and Remove now run on Npgsql: null maps to DBNull, Guid maps to text following GuidStringHandler); test project now consumes Rochas.CacheIndexer 1.1.0 from NuGet instead of a local ProjectReference. v1.9.8 - Contracts moved to Rochas.Data.Specification (DataSpecification), replacing the internal Rochas.DapperRepository.Specification project.",
